口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片）","quote_sha256":"ccf07119717f3fa90e04b92b33e27377ff105b4992510e5a2952ecf48c41b8c8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es03"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"适应症：1型发作性睡病（成人和青少年中重度日间过度嗜睡与猝倒）","quote_sha256":"ca0f477d133189e2fd0e7a9ced16fd05e95607ad2a4944edc8c4c79e79a9be3e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"研究分期：II期","quote_sha256":"0cd03d3b6552ef4d709f859513123058d34ed8e8f0e5ae9b9b7e718967255947","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es05"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es06"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"内在研究目的：首次患者试验（first-in-patient）；药理/药效探索；概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"9446f688f9a59b8b0a2b67d283cbeebbe441b61cfbcc1bbce6aac72d65128458","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"总体研究设计：多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照 II期概念验证与剂量探索研究；受试者1:1:1随机至三个剂量组序贯推进（剂量探索部分安全导入了隐藏的安慰剂对照），确证部分两剂量组+安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"442c24b8aa750fff1a2fdad58f71a312bc429962c0737d8417407c3cc0cc5a9b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es08"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"目标研究人群：成人（18-65岁）1型发作性睡病患者，确诊≥1年，主诉中重度日间过度嗜睡（ESS≥14且MWT平均睡眠潜伏期≤14分钟），伴或不伴猝倒；正在接受稳定莫达非尼治疗者需洗脱后入组。","quote_sha256":"6acf135d9fdfa3d7b66070df0d097509429c664b64c5588e894f3f9e2f6507b8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es09"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"分配模型：平行组","quote_sha256":"5e70b0bc5b3a55e709991ab54941ee36f3a7e04e4d8d776ac74298515efc5ab1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es11"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"试验组与对照组：KZ-NC401 低剂量组（25 mg 晨服，口服）；KZ-NC401 高剂量组（75 mg 晨服，口服）；安慰剂对照组","quote_sha256":"c37cd5757378773ed2072fef178fa601671529061e59a0ff879a4ecd665cd7cd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es12"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es13"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es14"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"SRC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c313c8ef9ed6e2107818bc5d2c8caa143c85bf55ac51060b4e8cc53c959daf6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es15"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es17"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es18"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es19"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es20"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"研究人群概述：成人（18-65岁）1型发作性睡病患者，诊断≥1年（ICSD-3标准），中重度日间过度嗜睡（基线ESS≥14且MWT平均睡眠潜伏期≤14分钟），伴或不伴猝倒；体重指数18-32 kg/m²；允许稳定莫达非尼背景治疗经洗脱后入组。","quote_sha256":"67c880774661e9310663bf6f35cff5107f3ecec86fa3364de0536d89b908ca90","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es21"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄18-65岁（含），确诊1型发作性睡病≥1年（ICSD-3标准，含nPSG+MSLT记录）；基线ESS≥14且MWT平均睡眠潜伏期≤14分钟；受试者本人签署知情同意并能遵守访视安排。","quote_sha256":"b7a1d4b4360ccf8eacd6be38cd2f033e813d215c56ffc88796c5ee39587af9f5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es22"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"排除标准模块：筛选前3个月内参与其他干预性研究；存在未经治疗的重度阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停或发作性睡病以外的显著睡眠病理；有临床意义的肝肾功能异常（ALT/AST>2×ULN或eGFR<50 mL/min/1.73m²）；妊娠或哺乳期女性。；筛选期12导联ECG提示QTcF>450ms或存在未控制的心律失常；研究者判定存在任何可能增加研究风险或干扰评估的疾病或情况。","quote_sha256":"612ac8b303fdf95a7839565e515ed88a816fb59fea323613e5655f78164beefd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es23"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"洗脱要求：入组前正在使用莫达非尼/阿莫达非尼者须洗脱≥7天；入组前14天内使用羟丁酸钠或兴奋剂类药物者须洗脱；研究期间禁止合并使用其他促醒药物。；随机前48小时内饮用含咖啡因或酒精饮料并可能影响基线MSLT/MWT评估者，须推迟随机至符合条件。","quote_sha256":"48d3235e4f7310d7492fa0ae1139270d5ec0c46abd9e7e643d0a888d0325c089","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es24"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"试验干预：KZ-NC401薄膜衣片口服，每日一次晨服；双盲治疗期12周，低剂量组25 mg、高剂量组75 mg（经2周滴定至目标剂量）；剂量依据内部IB v2.3（§5.1 剂量方案）设定；安慰剂对照组接受外观一致安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"b50197ac8133f0ecdb1d9c005d68be0dee472e5274180295efa7541b16e96f9d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KZ-NC401（口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片）：KZ-NC401片口服：第1-2周 25 mg 每日一次（高剂量组第3周起增至75 mg 每日一次），晨起后30分钟内服用，连续给药至第12周；漏服当日不再补服；剂量出处：内部IB v2.3 §5.1（立项剂量方案）。","quote_sha256":"f8e28c716ee8582b1726eaeb75a7092e01ba24d28a51ae6285a23e6f3db0c862","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es26"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照，1:1:1随机分配至KZ-NC401低剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂对照组；分层因素为基线猝倒有无（是/否）与地区；安慰剂外观、口味与活性药一致并由不参与评估的药师发放以维持盲态。","quote_sha256":"fb2a2c11a6bea582f97eb04548c5bc63eefcc76a0f5f89b9b06d63a4deeb17a2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es27"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"对照：安慰剂平行对照，1:1:1随机分配至KZ-NC401低剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂对照组；分层因素为基线猝倒有无（是/否）与地区；安慰剂外观、口味与活性药一致并由不参与评估的药师发放以维持盲态。","quote_sha256":"81b87c0bdd1177615ab030193dc46bc33547b2dc9d9c3181236208aa369e7135","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es28"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"主要终点：第12周维持觉醒试验（MWT）平均睡眠潜伏期较基线的变化（分钟）；评价时间：基线与第12周各一次MWT，治疗期访视窗口±3天；与安慰剂比较。","quote_sha256":"651ce32baabd9dd3b285f40d2966cafa194d6cc9c513340a27ab2b08e688953e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es29"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"关键次要终点：第12周ESS总分校基线变化；第12周MSLT平均睡眠潜伏期较基线变化；每周猝倒发作次数较基线变化（患者日记，第4/8/12周）。","quote_sha256":"e15871fd047a1551197da28d7cac8b836e26d1f2fa4b4e2024cf3704f8d5a68e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es30"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"安全性终点：治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）发生率与严重程度（CTCAE 5.0）；生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查较基线变化；自杀风险量表（C-SSRS）动态监测。","quote_sha256":"9fc3c1f63e76620376de07f7230b1966d7ab3c3814a2865c81bb07f987e4ef10","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es31"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"特别关注的不良事件：睡眠瘫痪恶性加重；日间过度镇静相关事件（跌倒/交通事故风险）；5-羟色胺综合征样事件。","quote_sha256":"5dc835022b257256afcf5f893bb9f326416e6b77e90ab7ce9e15d2850fa8a9ae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es32"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（≤28天）；双盲治疗期（12周）；安全随访期（4周）","quote_sha256":"a377431067b15c1efa1915f6a4e4d020f2baa804fad94a5ef6a0cb9f321e30d0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es33"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"访视策略：筛选（V1）、基线随机（V2）、治疗期第2/4/8/12周（V3-V6，含MWT/MSLT与ESS评估、猝倒日记核查）、安全性随访（V7，停药后4周内）；MWT与MSLT在基线和第12周各进行一次，评估窗口±3天。","quote_sha256":"efc1979e6bb6290d332475e2a77d1c55921e3945e30c1a7aec691ff4f234b78a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es34"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标采用治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否启用 rescue 药物或改变莫达非尼背景治疗，均按随机分组分析第12周 MWT 平均睡眠潜伏期较基线变化；对提前退出者在其退出前末次评估采用MMRM框架下的无懊悔插补。","quote_sha256":"7ad8fc6cafd98dc663917df2cd3b55c4eefce588cd984abb1a0da693c114baa3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es35"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"样本量策略：样本量假设：MWT平均睡眠潜伏期较安慰剂组间差2.0分钟、标准差SD 4.0分钟、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%；复算需每组85例（三组合计255例）；考虑15%脱落放大后每组100例，共300例。","quote_sha256":"4c478d02714d7c8a2ae52a171ca0d14fd0c1c76afd2530a48d5c9dccb0f6668b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es36"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"统计分析策略：主要分析集为FAS（所有随机受试者），符合方案集PPS为敏感性分析；主要终点采用MMRM比较各组与安慰剂第12周MWT平均睡眠潜伏期较基线变化，组间比较经Holm程序多重性校正；关键次要终点按Holm递阶策略控制族I类错误；安全性分析采用SS集描述性汇总。","quote_sha256":"da5497d9c49999dbfc9634d542b05282269cd5c32114b3810856cd169b862c94","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es37"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es01","es02","es03","es04","es05","es06","es07","es08","es09","es10","es11","es12","es13","es14","es15","es16","es17","es18","es19","es20","es21","es22","es23","es24","es25","es26","es27","es28","es29","es30","es31","es32","es33","es34","es35","es36","es37"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":37},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，方案编号MW-II-4E250244-DRAFT，开发区域为中国。研究药物为KZ-NC401（口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片），属小分子口服固体制剂，系统暴露。研究目的为首次患者试验、药理/药效探索、概念验证及剂量探索。目标人群为18至65岁成人1型发作性睡病患者，确诊≥1年（ICSD-3标准），基线Epworth嗜睡量表（ESS）评分≥14且维持觉醒试验（MWT）平均睡眠潜伏期≤14分钟，伴或不伴猝倒，体重指数18至32 kg/m²；正在接受稳定莫达非尼治疗者须洗脱≥7天后方可入组。受试者按1:1:1比例随机分配至KZ-NC401低剂量组（25 mg每日一次晨服）、KZ-NC401高剂量组（75 mg每日一次晨服，经2周滴定至目标剂量）及安慰剂对照组，分层因素为基线猝倒有无与地区。双盲治疗期12周，安全随访期4周，筛选期不超过28天。主要终点为第12周MWT平均睡眠潜伏期较基线的变化（分钟），与安慰剂比较；关键次要终点包括第12周ESS总分校基线变化、第12周MSLT平均睡眠潜伏期较基线变化及每周猝倒发作次数较基线变化（患者日记，第4/8/12周）。安全性评估涵盖治疗中出现的不良事件（CTCAE 5.0分级）、生命体征、12导联心电图、临床实验室检查及自杀风险量表（C-SSRS）动态监测。研究不设自适应设计、期中分析或SRC，设独立数据安全监查委员会（DMC）。样本量基于MWT平均睡眠潜伏期组间差2.0分钟、标准差4.0分钟、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%的假设，考虑15%脱落率后每组100例，三组合计300例。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS，所有随机受试者），符合方案集（PPS）作为敏感性分析，安全性分析采用安全性分析集（SS）进行描述性汇总。主要终点采用混合效应模型重复测量（MMRM）比较各组与安慰剂第12周MWT平均睡眠潜伏期较基线变化，组间比较经Holm程序多重性校正；关键次要终点按Holm递阶策略控制族I类错误。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实（方案编号、研究题目、设计类型、分期、开发区域、研究目的、目标人群、随机分配、剂量、治疗周期、终点、安全性评估、DMC、样本量、统计分析策略）撰写。'剂量探索部分安全导入了隐藏的安慰剂对照'及'确证部分两剂量组+安慰剂'的表述直接引自研究定义原文，其具体实施含义需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_da3dadfaef61_40c076d6cc816452","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:08067b096b86dcb5ad316dff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009002056_8da105cf","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充1型发作性睡病流行病学、疾病负担、病理机制、现行诊疗指南及当前治疗现状的项目级来源文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_01","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担与生活质量影响","现行诊疗指南","当前治疗现状与已上市药物疗效局限性"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状全章"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","疾病负担与生活质量影响","现行诊疗指南","当前治疗现状与已上市药物疗效局限性"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要1型发作性睡病的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、性别与年龄分布）、疾病自然史与病理机制（下丘脑食欲素神经元丧失导致睡眠-觉醒调控障碍）、疾病负担（对生活质量、职业功能、心理健康的影响）、现行诊疗指南（如中国发作性睡病诊治指南、AASM/ESRS指南）及当前治疗现状（莫达非尼、羟丁酸钠、替洛利生、索利氨酯等已上市药物的疗效与局限性）。当前允许来源中无上述任何类别的资料，仅有适应症名称'1型发作性睡病（成人和青少年中重度日间过度嗜睡与猝倒）'，不足以构成有实质信息的疾病背景正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_da3dadfaef61_6ee8b63cdf70c98f","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:08067b096b86dcb5ad316dff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261009002056_8da105cf","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"研究题目：KZ-NC401（口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片）用于治疗1型发作性睡病（成人和青少年中重度日间过度嗜睡与猝倒）的II期临床研究","quote_sha256":"bed33388b814c010d4ed6e3283286e095cf110f7a94b7546789d019fcbc4732a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es02"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"试验药物：KZ-NC401（口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片）","quote_sha256":"ccf07119717f3fa90e04b92b33e27377ff105b4992510e5a2952ecf48c41b8c8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es03"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"适应症：1型发作性睡病（成人和青少年中重度日间过度嗜睡与猝倒）","quote_sha256":"ca0f477d133189e2fd0e7a9ced16fd05e95607ad2a4944edc8c4c79e79a9be3e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"内在研究目的：首次患者试验（first-in-patient）；药理/药效探索；概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"9446f688f9a59b8b0a2b67d283cbeebbe441b61cfbcc1bbce6aac72d65128458","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es17"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es18"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es19"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es20"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"试验干预：KZ-NC401薄膜衣片口服，每日一次晨服；双盲治疗期12周，低剂量组25 mg、高剂量组75 mg（经2周滴定至目标剂量）；剂量依据内部IB v2.3（§5.1 剂量方案）设定；安慰剂对照组接受外观一致安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"b50197ac8133f0ecdb1d9c005d68be0dee472e5274180295efa7541b16e96f9d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es25"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KZ-NC401（口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片）：KZ-NC401片口服：第1-2周 25 mg 每日一次（高剂量组第3周起增至75 mg 每日一次），晨起后30分钟内服用，连续给药至第12周；漏服当日不再补服；剂量出处：内部IB v2.3 §5.1（立项剂量方案）。","quote_sha256":"f8e28c716ee8582b1726eaeb75a7092e01ba24d28a51ae6285a23e6f3db0c862","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es26"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照，1:1:1随机分配至KZ-NC401低剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂对照组；分层因素为基线猝倒有无（是/否）与地区；安慰剂外观、口味与活性药一致并由不参与评估的药师发放以维持盲态。","quote_sha256":"fb2a2c11a6bea582f97eb04548c5bc63eefcc76a0f5f89b9b06d63a4deeb17a2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es27"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:revision:7","quote":"对照：安慰剂平行对照，1:1:1随机分配至KZ-NC401低剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂对照组；分层因素为基线猝倒有无（是/否）与地区；安慰剂外观、口味与活性药一致并由不参与评估的药师发放以维持盲态。","quote_sha256":"81b87c0bdd1177615ab030193dc46bc33547b2dc9d9c3181236208aa369e7135","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","span_id":"es28"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es02","es03","es04","es07","es17","es18","es19","es20","es25","es26","es27","es28"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":12},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KZ-NC401 IB或等效药理学资料，明确OX2R选择性、对OX1R影响及下游信号通路","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_01","missing_source_classes":["研究药物详细作用机制与受体选择性数据"],"target":"研究药物简介中作用机制与受体选择性描述"},{"action":"补充非临床药效学（动物模型觉醒改善）及PK/PD研究报告","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_02","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学与药效学研究报告","非临床药代动力学与毒理学数据"],"target":"研究药物简介中非临床药效学与药代动力学摘要"},{"action":"确认是否存在既往IIT、I期或海外早期临床数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_03","missing_source_classes":["既往临床开发历史或早期临床数据"],"target":"研究药物简介中既往临床开发历史"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究药物详细作用机制与受体选择性数据","非临床药理学与药效学研究报告","非临床药代动力学与毒理学数据","既往临床开发历史或早期临床数据"],"proposal_text":"KZ-NC401为口服选择性食欲素2受体（OX2R）激动剂薄膜衣片，属小分子化合物，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂，系统暴露。本研究为KZ-NC401的首次患者试验（first-in-patient），同时承担药理/药效探索、概念验证及剂量探索目的。研究药物以每日一次晨服方式给药，低剂量组25 mg、高剂量组75 mg（经2周滴定至目标剂量），连续给药至第12周；安慰剂对照组接受外观与口味一致的安慰剂，由不参与评估的药师发放以维持盲态。剂量方案依据内部IB v2.3（§5.1 剂量方案）设定。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中关于药物名称、靶点类别（OX2R激动剂）、技术类型（small_molecule）、给药途径（口服）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、暴露范围（systemic）、研究目的（first-in-patient、药理/药效探索、PoC、剂量探索）、剂量与给药方案及安慰剂设计撰写。KZ-NC401的详细作用机制（如受体选择性倍数、对OX1R的影响）、体外与体内药效学数据、非临床药代动力学特征、非临床安全性摘要及既往临床开发历史均无来源支持，需补充IB或等效非临床资料后方可扩展。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_da3dadfaef61_b507ead5cecfc528","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:08067b096b86dcb5ad316dff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_3079f2462aad3d3b0321:r7:a61d6ff5087db323","company_corpus:cms_c